!.dev.vars.example
.env*
!.env.example
.wrangler/
node_modules/

# Clés de signature (elles vont dans les secrets GitHub, docs/cadrage.md)
*.jks
*.keystore
*.p8
*.p12
*.mobileprovision
google-services.json
GoogleService-Info.plist

